2. `swapFirstTwo(arr)`: Takes an array and returns a new array with the first two elements swapped and the rest unchanged. If array has fewer than 2 elements, returns a shallow copy of the array.
3. `mergeConfigs(base, overrides)`: Merges `base` and `overrides` into a new object. If a key exists in both, `overrides` takes precedence.

