2. `getInheritedPropertyNames(obj)`: Returns an array of all property names that `obj` inherits from its prototype chain (excluding its own properties and excluding properties on `Object.prototype`).
3. `hasPrototype(target, proto)`: Returns `true` if `proto` exists in `target`'s prototype chain, otherwise `false`.

