   - `get perimeter()`: returns `2 * (width + height)`.
   - `isSquare()`: returns `true` if `width === height`, else `false`.
2. `class Task`:
   - `#isCompleted` (private field initialized to `false`)
   - `constructor(title)`
   - `get title()`
   - `get isCompleted()`
   - `complete()`: sets `#isCompleted = true`
3. `class PriorityTask extends Task`:
   - `constructor(title, priority = "medium")`
